        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Broad brown and white stripes separated by deep pink and blue ones.  The brown stripe is covered with irregular shapes filled with various all-over designs, on this are roses and other flowers.  The white stripe has a design of grasses printed with brown and on this a stripe of poppy-like flowers on a thick stem.  Printed with red, blue, violet, green and yellow."@en ;
